# ATS-214 :: the Next.js 16 static export build
#
# The Turbopack build resolves `next/package.json` INSIDE the filesystem root it
# is given, and a JUNCTION to a dependency tree on another volume is NOT
# resolved by it. The build therefore ran on a copy of THIS TREE on D:,
# where apps/studio/node_modules is a real directory.
#
# The sources in the D: tree are THIS TASK'S sources, byte for byte.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
npm notice run @ai-test-studio/ui@0.1.0 build
npm notice run next build
